# Local-only reference docs (not committed). Note: /docs/* (not /docs/) so
# the negations below can re-include specific files — git can't un-ignore
# a file whose parent directory itself is excluded.
/CLAUDE.md
/docs/*
# ...except these two, which are part of this PR and linked from the
# README — the rest of docs/ (architecture/deployment notes) stays local.
